{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566820/extras/ba26bf9af5ee2417a4c7cc5bf85009fb.avif?t=1771518375\" width=200 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine: you're Barabosa, a daring dog in a red cape, soaring through endless clouds. Floating islands sway, spin, and drift on the wind. One wrong leap \u2014 and you're plummeting into the abyss. Can you conquer the sky's peaks?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High Clouds (\u041f\u043e\u0432\u044b\u0448\u0435\u043d\u043d\u0430\u044f \u041e\u0431\u043b\u0430\u0447\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442\u044c) is an indie 3D platformer by a solo dev (2+ years in the making). Dive into unpredictable vertical parkour where every level tests luck and skill. Demo out now \u2014 jump in!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566820/extras/41acf721a13b6e8f4763021a2534b055.poster.avif?t=1771518375\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566820/extras/41acf721a13b6e8f4763021a2534b055.webm?t=1771518375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566820/extras/41acf721a13b6e8f4763021a2534b055.mp4?t=1771518375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf2a\ufe0f Islands That Fight Back</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Platforms move on their own: rocking, rotating, colliding. Add random wind gusts \u2014 mission accomplished?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Always upward! No horizontal running \u2014 just jumps, flights, and climbs. No turning back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc15\u200d Flight Arsenal Barabosa</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Double jump + cape gliding: surf between clouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Grapple hook: latch on, swing, and launch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Delta wing and gadgets: ship for scouting, pistol for... you'll see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566820/extras/b8f186801a4db7b8b22a97d4c5f1c077.poster.avif?t=1771518375\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566820/extras/b8f186801a4db7b8b22a97d4c5f1c077.webm?t=1771518375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566820/extras/b8f186801a4db7b8b22a97d4c5f1c077.mp4?t=1771518375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\ud83d\udcc8 Latest Updates (Jan 2026)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Two new levels: bigger, tougher, packed with puzzles and secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Graphics glow-up: textures, lighting, new models (ship &amp; pistol).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Optimized: smooth on mid-range PCs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3566820/extras/7615cd5ec669546c310bddf248d6df43.avif?t=1771518375\" width=1254 height=823 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Barabosa</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Barabosa is your hero \u2014 a fearless dog in a red cape with big dreams. He wants to reach the Moon, and nothing will stop her on her journey through the clouds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not just a platformer \u2014 a 3D sky reaction test. Russian roots, global vibes (RU/EN). Release 2026, beta soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist to support so